[[Category:Domesticated]]
[[Category:Tmp_xyobj(neg)]]

Pigs are domesticated creatures, kept usually for their low upkeep requirements and for [[Pork]]'s uses in various recipes, they are also a good source of [[Animal Fat]]. In order to obtain pigs you must [[Taming|tame]] [[Boar]]s. Pigs can be lead around by equipping a [[Rope]], right-clicking on the animal, and selecting 'Leash'. While leading a pig it will occasionally sniff up [[Black Truffles|Black]], [[White Truffles|White]] or [[Blue Truffles]]. These act similarly to [[Black Pepper|Pepper]].
 
Pigs can have twins or triplets on rare occasions.

==Hog==

Hogs give 1-2 Boar Tusk when their bones are collected, sows do not.

==Advantages To Pigs==

Pigs give [[Raw Pork]] instead of Boar Meat. Pork has all of the same applications as Boar meat and can also where Boar Meat cannot be. Full grown pigs also give two [[Fresh Pigskin]], a 2 tile hide with no known use other than generic hide recipes.

See [[Animal Qualities]] for more information.

